      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi @{6a440e4ef51f79a5db8b185f|full_name}, it seems like you've submitted a support request to the incorrect channel. VRChat Feedback bug reports board is for reproducible bug reports with steps to reproduce, are not related to your own setup, and have \"expected\" and \"actual\" result. One bug report per topic, please.\n\nFor isolated issues or customer support visit https://help.vrchat.com/\n\nSee: https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/360062658413-I-found-a-bug-I-want-to-report-a-bug",
