  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Okay, so I’ve been experiencing an issue where I can’t see invite requests, nor can I send invites. I crash immediately after opening the game, have to wait forever just to have to reopen it, it takes forever for video links to load (one time it took 20 minutes to load a 43 second video) and it randomly says my friend location is “title” 100 friends and 100 people (whenever I don’t even HAVE 100 friends on my friends list?) as well as the fact the search doesn’t work. I’ve redownloaded the app on my headset, I’ve cleared the cash, I’ve let my headset sit for a bit- I just don’t know what’s going on! (It’s a Quest 3) it wasn’t behaving this way a few weeks ago, and it happened out of NOWHERE.\n\nAnother bug is that my mic stops working and I can’t hear anybody, and when I reopen the platform, it KEEPS HAPPENING, leading to me being forced to go on PC. \n\nI only have 2 games on my headset so it can’t be because I have no storage either.",
